1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,780
准备好露营之旅了吗
Ready for your big camping trip?

2
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:04,120
你确定需要的东西都准备好了吗
You sure you got everything you need?

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,920
除了一样没了我就会真正迷失的...
Everything but the one thing I'd truly be lost without...

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:07,900
你的凯美瑞
Your Camry.

5
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:09,220
我的导航坏了
My GPS is broken.

6
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:10,288
我们可以交换车吗
Can we trade cars?

7
00:00:10,288 --> 00:00:13,180
我最近离开了我的房地产公司
I recently left my real-estate partners

8
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:14,820
开始自主创业
to strike out on my own.

9
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:18,640
但在开始面对疯狂的房屋市场之前
But before facing the wilds of the housing market,

10
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,960
我要先在优胜美地国家公园
I'm gonna boost my confidence

11
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:23,350
露营六个晚上 然后在川汤小屋度过一晚
with six rugged nights of camping at Yosemite National Park

12
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:25,960
来提振我的信心
and one at the Kawayu Lodge.

13
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:27,840
当然了 我也担心
I'm concerned, of course,

14
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:30,260
重新适应现代文明会有困难
about readjusting to civilization,

15
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:32,820
所以预定了花园套房
so I've reserved the garden suite

16
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:35,120
以防我更习惯睡在户外
in case I'm more comfortable sleeping outside.

17
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:40,600
因为我能想象到自己
Only because I am picturing myself

18
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:42,940
与大队人马举着手电筒在森林里找人的画面
in a line of people sweeping the woods with flashlights,

19
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:46,140
你确定在树林里待一周没问题吗
are you sure a week in the woods is a good idea?

20
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:48,420
亲爱的 要说有问题 那大概是准备过头了
Sweetheart, if anything, I'm over prepared.

21
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:49,880
我准备了两周的食物
I have two weeks worth of food,

22
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:51,060
净水器
water purifiers...

23
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:52,700
信号枪
a flare gun.

24
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:54,480
别在屋里挥那玩意儿
Oh, don't wave that thing around in the house.

25
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:55,460
给我一点信任好不好
Give me a little bit of credit.

26
00:00:55,460 --> 00:00:57,460
我又不会在屋里开信号枪
I'm not gonna shoot off a flare gun in the house.

27
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:16,042
莉莉 图书馆发短信说
Hey, Lily, the library is saying

28
00:01:16,042 --> 00:01:17,720
《斑斑独角斑马》
that "Stripey the Zebracorn"

29
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:19,108
已经拖欠两个月没还了
is two months overdue?

30
00:01:19,108 --> 00:01:20,180
这...这是什么情况
What -- what's that about?

31
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:21,360
图书馆新来了个管理员
We have a new librarian,

32
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:22,460
她有点...
and she's a little...

33
00:01:22,870 --> 00:01:25,420
她经常喝醉乱发邮件
She's been drunk e-mailing a lot.

34
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:26,480
真可怜
Oh, that poor thing.

35
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:28,241
莉莉 去把那本书找来
Lily, go find that book.

36
00:01:28,241 --> 00:01:30,332
罚款从你的零花钱里扣
And the fine's coming out of your allowance.

37
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:32,580
你这人是不是什么鬼话都信
You'll really believe anything, won't you?

38
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:33,640
我才不会
I will not.

39
00:01:33,860 --> 00:01:35,000
是吗 好吧
Really? Okay...

40
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:37,142
还记得你让你奶奶
Um, hey, remember when you had your grandmother

41
00:01:37,142 --> 00:01:39,760
给我们寄一个阿巴拉契亚魔法玩偶吗
ship us a certain Appalachian hex poppet

42
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:42,380
-因为你觉得我们的房子有邪灵 -是啊
- because you thought our house had evil spirits? - Okay, yeah.

43
00:01:42,380 --> 00:01:43,420
不然你还能更好地解释
Do you have a better explanation

44
00:01:43,420 --> 00:01:44,760
为什么我们的墙里回荡着
of why there were cries and giggles

45
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:46,580
-哭声和笑声吗 -可以
- echoing through our walls? - ?Yes.

46
00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:49,260
我们的装修工在某个通风口发现了这个
Our contractor found this in one of the vents.

47
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:50,320
听听
Listen...

48
00:01:52,520 --> 00:01:53,831
没错 我觉得这是那种
Yeah, I think it's one of those dolls

49
00:01:53,831 --> 00:01:55,120
给那些极有可能怀孕的
they give high-school girls

50
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,720
高中女生准备的娃娃
who are high risk for getting pregnant?

51
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:59,200
我们家什么时候来过那种姑娘了
When would one of those girls have been in this house?

52
00:02:00,540 --> 00:02:03,339
应该是我在当莉莉保姆
I think I was babysitting Lily,

53
00:02:03,339 --> 00:02:06,196
然后我记得最后好像开了个派对
and I kinda remember it turning into a party situation.

54
00:02:06,196 --> 00:02:09,756
当时似乎空调排风很大
You know, I sort of recall the air conditioning blasting

55
00:02:09,756 --> 00:02:11,500
我不得不硬塞一些东西到通风口里堵住
and I had to shove something in the vent to block it,

56
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:13,100
其实我已经很靠谱了
which was pretty responsible,

57
00:02:13,100 --> 00:02:14,300
毕竟当时我朋友艾丽西娅
considering my friend Alicia

58
00:02:14,300 --> 00:02:15,580
带了她的真宝宝来呢
brought her actual baby there.

59
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:18,680
太多青少年走上歪路
So many teens going down the wrong path.

60
00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:19,547
我每天都目睹
I see it every day.

61
00:02:19,547 --> 00:02:21,740
你好像在转移话题
Uh, seems like you're trying to change the subject

62
00:02:21,740 --> 00:02:22,740
不承认自己容易被骗哦
from you being gullible.

63
00:02:22,900 --> 00:02:24,820
那是因为我更有爱心
Only because I have a more pressing concern.

64
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:27,320
今天我要第一次作为代理副校长
Today, I have to oversee my first detention

65
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:28,589
监督留校察看的坏学生
as acting vice principal,

66
00:02:28,589 --> 00:02:30,640
我在...我绞尽脑汁在考虑
and I'm -- I've just been racking my brain

67
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:32,095
我该如何触动这些孩子
of how I'm gonna reach these kids.

68
00:02:32,095 --> 00:02:33,300
这是留校察看
It's, uh, detention.

69
00:02:33,300 --> 00:02:34,540
直接说"闭嘴做作业"怎么样
How about "Shut up and do your homework"?

70
00:02:38,313 --> 00:02:39,321
她...她是被鬼附身吗
What's -- what's wrong with her?

71
00:02:39,321 --> 00:02:40,572
需要把魔法玩偶拿来吗
Should I get the hex poppet?

72
00:02:40,572 --> 00:02:42,096
我在哭而已
I'm just cry-talking.

73
00:02:42,096 --> 00:02:44,460
-我给卡尔换衣服的时候 脖子扭了 -糟糕
- I threw my neck out changing Cal. - ?Oh, no.

74
00:02:44,460 --> 00:02:47,500
现在我一动 整个人都得跟着动
Now whenever I move, all of me comes with it.

75
00:02:47,552 --> 00:02:48,440
天啊 这样吧
Oh, gosh. Oh, you know what?

76
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:50,600
干脆让我们照顾一会儿卡尔
Why don't you let us take baby Cal,

77
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:53,420
你去让人按摩一下
and you go get yourself a rubdown.

78
00:02:54,140 --> 00:02:55,379
你真是天使
You're an angel.

79
00:02:55,379 --> 00:02:57,273
应该不会超过几小时
Shouldn't be but a few hours.

80
00:02:58,961 --> 00:03:01,020
你不会比我想象的还要蠢吧
Hey, are you an even bigger rube than I thought?

81
00:03:01,020 --> 00:03:02,440
她的脖子根本没事
There's nothing wrong with her neck.

82
00:03:02,820 --> 00:03:04,500
-我的天啊 宝宝 -怎么了
- Oh my God, the baby! - ?What?!

83
00:03:05,260 --> 00:03:05,758
不
No!

84
00:03:05,758 --> 00:03:07,400
他 他冲我眨眼睛呢
He -- he winked at me.

85
00:03:08,540 --> 00:03:09,520
你一定会喜欢的 乔
You're gonna love it, Joe.

86
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,540
我爸当年带我去看像这样的飞行表演
My dad took me to an air show like this

87
00:03:11,540 --> 00:03:12,540
来庆祝我12岁的生日
for my 12th birthday.

88
00:03:12,940 --> 00:03:15,318
我们看到了蓝天使 战斗机
We saw Blue Angels, fighter jets,

89
00:03:15,318 --> 00:03:16,880
一架B-52轰炸机
a B-52 bomber.

90
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:19,220
-什么被炸了吗 -我爸被灌炸了
- Something got bombed? - Well, my dad.

91
00:03:19,540 --> 00:03:21,680
他跟几个飞行员比赛喝酒被灌倒
He got in a drinking contest with some fly boys.

92
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:23,057
结果也因此变得更好玩了
But that just made it extra fun,

93
00:03:23,057 --> 00:03:24,700
因为最后成了我开车带我爸回家
'cause I got to drive us home.

94
00:03:24,700 --> 00:03:26,520
乔 为什么堡垒
Joe, why is the fort

95
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:28,300
还在客厅中央
still in the middle of the living room?

96
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:30,840
-我需要 -需要干嘛 防印第安人吗
- I need it. For what? Apaches?

97
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:31,960
你被攻击了吗
Are you being attacked?

98
00:03:32,300 --> 00:03:33,420
感觉现在就在被攻击
Feels like it.

99
00:03:33,580 --> 00:03:34,200
快拆掉
Take it down.

100
00:03:34,220 --> 00:03:35,920
我已经跟你说三次了
I've told you three times already.

101
00:03:36,020 --> 00:03:37,200
你现在不拆的话
If you don't do it now,

102
00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:38,720
我们就不去看飞行表演了
we're not going to the air show.

103
00:03:39,020 --> 00:03:40,780
等等 不公平 为什么要惩罚我
Wait, no fair! Why am I being punished?

104
00:03:42,180 --> 00:03:44,500
我没想到你们这会儿会在家
Oh, I didn't expect you guys to be home.

105
00:03:44,500 --> 00:03:46,245
我们就打算来用一下泳池
Uh, we're just gonna use the pool.

106
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:47,560
杰 歌洛莉亚
Jay, Gloria...

107
00:03:48,260 --> 00:03:48,520
歌洛莉亚
Gloria?

108
00:03:48,740 --> 00:03:50,040
这是凯伦·菲斯科博士
This is Dr. Karen Fisk.

109
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:51,520
她是我们学校的律动教师
She's a movement teacher at my school.

110
00:03:51,620 --> 00:03:53,120
你儿子非常有天赋
Your son is very talented.

111
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:54,380
非常高兴
Well, it's always very nice

112
00:03:54,380 --> 00:03:55,940
能见到曼尼的老师
to meet one of Manny's teachers.

113
00:03:56,340 --> 00:03:58,040
我去给各位倒点喝的
Why don't I get us something to drink

114
00:03:58,040 --> 00:04:00,440
再准备些好吃的布朗尼
and maybe some delicious brownies

115
00:04:00,440 --> 00:04:01,840
我本来打算扔掉的
that I was about to throw away

116
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:03,740
因为那是只给好孩子准备的
because they're only for the good children!

117
00:04:04,420 --> 00:04:05,900
布朗尼你留着吧
Keep your brownies!

118
00:04:06,785 --> 00:04:08,980
曼尼努力装成熟
It's cute, that grown-up routine

119
00:04:08,980 --> 00:04:10,800
来博取他女朋友好感的样子太可爱了
Manny's putting on to impress his girlfriend.

120
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,720
她才不是他女朋友
She's not his girlfriend.

121
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:13,940
她是他的老师
She's his teacher.

122
00:04:13,940 --> 00:04:15,500
歌洛莉亚 他是在
Gloria, he brought her home

123
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:17,020
以为家里没人的时间把她带回家
when he thought no one would be around.

124
00:04:17,420 --> 00:04:19,320
曼尼从小时候起
Manny has been bringing his teachers home

125
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:20,739
就常带老师回家
since he was a little kid.

126
00:04:20,739 --> 00:04:24,600
他的九岁生日派对最后变成了家长会
His 9th birthday party turned into a PTA meeting.

127
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,520
歌洛莉亚 我认为你这是
Gloria, I think you're just not seeing

128
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:27,860
故意无视你不想看到的
what you don't want to see.

129
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:30,140
相信我 杰 什么都逃不出我的眼睛
Believe me, Jay, I see everything.

130
00:04:32,340 --> 00:04:35,179
牙医说新牙齿维持器应该明天就到了
The dentist says your new mouth guard should be there tomorrow.

131
00:04:35,179 --> 00:04:37,849
艾丽克斯 你一晚不戴不会死的
Alex, I am sure you can make it through one night...

132
00:04:38,301 --> 00:04:39,520
我哪知道
I-I don't know,

133
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:41,700
去材料实验室自己鼓捣一个来顶一下吧
hit the materials lab and whip up some mouth flubber.

134
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:43,455
克莱尔 谢天谢地
Claire, thank goodness.

135
00:04:43,455 --> 00:04:46,060
运货卡车有点搞混了
There was a bit of a trucking mix-up.

136
00:04:46,060 --> 00:04:48,500
尔文被安排去朱利安 不能去维塞利亚了
Irving was sent to Julian and can't get to Visalia.

137
00:04:48,900 --> 00:04:50,700
那让达斯汀去维塞利亚
Well, send Dustin to Visalia

138
00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:52,760
再让尔文去朱利安和拉蒙纳
and have Irving hit Julian and Ramona.

139
00:04:52,860 --> 00:04:55,180
达斯汀不能同时送去维塞利亚和尔湾
Dustin can't hit Visalia and also Irvine.

140
00:04:55,420 --> 00:04:57,160
那朱利娅能送去尔湾吗
Well, can Julia hit Irvine?

141
00:04:57,260 --> 00:04:59,297
-不能同时去尔湾和塔斯廷 -那好
- Not Irvine and Tustin. - Fine...

142
00:04:59,297 --> 00:05:01,500
让朱利娅去朱利安 拉蒙去拉蒙纳
Send Julia to Julian, Ramon to Ramona,

143
00:05:01,500 --> 00:05:03,160
达斯汀去塔斯廷 尔文去尔湾
Dustin to Tustin, Irving to Irvine,

144
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,840
再由我亲自把破货车开去维塞利亚
and I'll drive the damn truck to Visalia!

145
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:07,299
-你吗 -是的 当然是我 玛格丽特
- You? - ?Yes, of course me, Margaret!

146
00:05:07,299 --> 00:05:09,940
因为好像什么问题都得我来解决
'Cause I have to handle everything anyhow!

147
00:05:09,940 --> 00:05:11,189
舍我其谁
If not me, who?

148
00:05:11,189 --> 00:05:13,905
不 "琪谁"要去卡尔斯巴德
Oh, no. Mi Hu is going to Carlsbad.

149
00:05:15,460 --> 00:05:17,160
这些就是你们的未来
These are your future,

150
00:05:17,244 --> 00:05:22,680
而它们飞出了窗户
And they're headed...out...the window...

151
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:24,119
一去不复返
never to return.

152
00:05:24,119 --> 00:05:25,347
是你掉的吗 教练
You drop this, Coach?

153
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:26,320
是的
Yes.

154
00:05:29,060 --> 00:05:29,974
肯定是万圣节到了
Oh, it must be Halloween,

155
00:05:29,974 --> 00:05:31,520
因为有人在交头接耳[发巧克力棒]
because somebody's passing out snickers!

156
00:05:31,520 --> 00:05:31,720
肖恩
Shane?

157
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,360
抱歉 我无意打断你
Sorry, I didn't mean to interrupt.

158
00:05:33,410 --> 00:05:34,725
没关系 肖恩
Oh, it's okay, Shane.

159
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:35,820
我了解你这一型
I know your type.

160
00:05:36,180 --> 00:05:37,440
硬汉 自以为聪明
Tough guy. Know it all.

161
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:38,760
这就像照镜子一样
It's like looking in a mirror.

162
00:05:38,820 --> 00:05:39,560
没错 肖恩
That's right, Shane.

163
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:41,060
我当年和你一样
I was you.

164
00:05:41,550 --> 00:05:43,430
直到当地的警长把我抓进了牢房
Till a local sheriff put me in jail.

165
00:05:43,737 --> 00:05:46,680
那是个名叫"吓到你乖[变直]"的项目
In a little program called Scared Straight,

166
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,080
现在我大声说出来
which, now that I'm saying it out loud,

167
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:49,580
才觉得似乎还有另一层意思
could have had a double meaning.

168
00:05:49,860 --> 00:05:51,800
我在拘留所关了24小时
24 hours in the joint

169
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:55,400
和地狱里来的危险角色关在一起
with some of the most dangerous characters this side of Hell.

170
00:05:56,020 --> 00:05:56,540
或许
Maybe,

171
00:05:57,620 --> 00:05:59,100
或许你们也想见见他们
Maybe you'd like to meet some of them.

172
00:06:02,149 --> 00:06:03,919
我不知道你这是在瞅啥
I don't know what you're lookin' at,

173
00:06:03,949 --> 00:06:07,622
因为爷不记得批准你瞅我了
'cause I don't ever remember sellin' you a lookin' license!

174
00:06:10,415 --> 00:06:12,860
看来现在是凌晨五点的麦当劳门口
Hey, it must be 5:00 a.m. outside the McDonald's,

175
00:06:12,860 --> 00:06:15,580
因为又有小鲜肉到货了
because the fresh meat just got delivered!

176
00:06:15,580 --> 00:06:17,780
鼬爷我贼喜欢小鲜肉
And the Weasel likes fresh meat!

177
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:19,560
你别碰他
Hey, you back off him!

178
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,560
那是我的新宠
That new boy's mine!

179
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,840
小卡舅夫啊
Uncle Cam...

180
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:25,220
点赞
"Like."

181
00:06:26,100 --> 00:06:27,100
我朋友 比利
My friend, Billy.

182
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:28,320
比利·克拉布
Billy Club.

183
00:06:28,445 --> 00:06:29,965
-小卡啊 -看我捶你
- Ay, Cam... - Whack!

184
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:31,540
点赞
"Like."

185
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:35,660
你知道怎么开卡车吗
Do you even know how to drive a truck?

186
00:06:35,660 --> 00:06:37,320
不 玛格丽特 我不知道
No, Margaret, I don't...

187
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:39,760
但和世界上其他人不同
but unlike the rest of the world,

188
00:06:39,900 --> 00:06:42,520
有时我会靠自己解决问题
sometimes I just figure things out on my own.

189
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:45,930
倒车
Backing up...

190
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:51,140
闭嘴 玛格丽特
Shut up, Margaret.

191
00:06:52,440 --> 00:06:53,840
生存影像日志 第一条
Survival vlog, entry one.

192
00:06:54,051 --> 00:06:56,431
在徒步八公里又乘着急流而下后
After a five-mile hike and ride down some rapids,

193
00:06:56,431 --> 00:06:58,289
我决定在这里扎营
I've decided to make my camp here.

194
00:06:58,480 --> 00:07:00,260
急流非常危险
The rapids were treacherous.

195
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:01,460
顺流而下后
I took on water

196
00:07:01,460 --> 00:07:03,840
我很快意识到我唯一生存下去的办法
and quickly realized my only chance for survival

197
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:05,700
就是将我的同伴推下水
was to push my companion overboard --

198
00:07:05,711 --> 00:07:09,260
我如影随形的同伴 恐惧
my constant companion...fear.

199
00:07:09,908 --> 00:07:11,625
求你们别开到我的盲区
Please stay out of my blind spot.

200
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:12,260
并道
Merging.

201
00:07:13,300 --> 00:07:13,660
并道
Merging!

202
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:15,220
抱歉
Sorry!

203
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:16,640
这就是事实
Here's the thing.

204
00:07:16,700 --> 00:07:18,900
在野外 你要么在挑战前畏缩
In the wild, you either shrink from the challenge,

205
00:07:18,900 --> 00:07:21,080
要么意识到有信心就成功了一半
or you realize that confidence is half the battle

206
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:23,000
变成环境的掌控者
and you become the master of your environment.

207
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:23,900
好吧
Okay...

208
00:07:25,820 --> 00:07:26,340
好的
All right.

209
00:07:26,580 --> 00:07:28,480
谢谢 谢谢 谢谢你
Thank you, thank you. Thank you.

210
00:07:29,114 --> 00:07:30,474
也不是很难
This isn't so bad.

211
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:31,400
挺好的
Yeah.

212
00:07:32,500 --> 00:07:34,820
没错 普锐斯 给姐让路
That's right, Prius... Move it.

213
00:07:35,180 --> 00:07:35,460
没错
Yep.

214
00:07:35,700 --> 00:07:38,320
有时你只需要挺起胸膛
Sometimes it's just a matter of thrusting your chest out,

215
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:39,840
捍卫你的立场
staking your claim...

216
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:43,440
让大自然知道 现在由你这新警长做主
and letting nature know there's a new sheriff in town.

217
00:07:52,500 --> 00:07:55,560
西班牙辣香肠和大蕉都太好吃了
This chorizo, these plantains, it's all so delicious.

218
00:07:55,780 --> 00:07:57,658
你什么时候开始爱吃哥伦比亚菜了
When did you develop a taste for Colombian?

219
00:07:57,658 --> 00:07:59,440
这叫帕伊萨拼盘
It's called bandeja paisa.

220
00:07:59,440 --> 00:08:00,960
天资好 人聪明
Oh, talented, smart,

221
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,260
还会说西班牙语
and speaks Spanish.

222
00:08:04,180 --> 00:08:05,300
拜托
Oh, please.

223
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:07,598
谁不想摸他脸颊啊
Everybody wants to touch those cheeks.

224
00:08:07,598 --> 00:08:09,820
他看起来像教堂天花板上
He looks like one of those babies

225
00:08:09,820 --> 00:08:12,720
吹出云彩的肥宝宝
that blow a cloud across the ceiling of a church.

226
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:15,580
凯伦教授 告诉我们你教什么课程
So, tell us, Dr. Karen, what do you teach?

227
00:08:15,860 --> 00:08:17,480
直接展示给你们看最好不过了
Well, the best way would be to show you.

228
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:19,980
-不如我们动起来 -真有趣
- Why don't we find our legs? - ?Fun.

229
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:22,820
站在我旁边跟着我做
Now stand beside me and follow along.

230
00:08:23,340 --> 00:08:27,720
想象你正提着两桶水
Imagine you're carrying two pails of water.

231
00:08:28,660 --> 00:08:29,220
深呼吸
Deep breath.

232
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:31,320
不不不 你不该挺胸
No, no, no. Your chest shouldn't be lifting.

233
00:08:31,420 --> 00:08:32,600
来把你的手放到我脖子上
Come place your hands on my neck.

234
00:08:35,300 --> 00:08:37,940
感觉到我的呼吸有多顺畅了吗
Do you feel how still and open my breathing is?

235
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,900
我这里有些敏感
Oh, a little sensitive there.

236
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,360
是啊 这里有块小吻痕
Yeah, you have a little bite there.

237
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:42,520
怪我下嘴没轻重
Oh, my bad.

238
00:08:43,280 --> 00:08:44,800
你有点太用力了
Okay, that's a little tight.

239
00:08:44,940 --> 00:08:47,480
但我现在知道曼尼柔软的手是随谁了
But I can see where Manny gets his soft hands from!

240
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:50,202
-真是大开眼界 -妈 妈
- Oh, that's very, very eye-opening. - Mom. Mom.

241
00:08:50,202 --> 00:08:52,570
我们去厨房看看甜点好了没
Uh, let's check on the dessert in the kitchen.

242
00:08:54,860 --> 00:08:58,460
什么样的学校会允许教师和学生约会
What kind of schools allow a teacher to date a student?

243
00:08:58,500 --> 00:08:59,836
我想艺术学院都这样
I'm guessing any art school.

244
00:08:59,836 --> 00:09:02,280
他不能和三十岁的人约会
He can't date a 30-year-old.

245
00:09:02,900 --> 00:09:04,020
曼尼还是个孩子
Manny's still a child.

246
00:09:04,160 --> 00:09:06,460
我初次见到曼尼时他就不是孩子了
Manny wasn't a child when I met him.

247
00:09:06,830 --> 00:09:08,060
曾经有十年时间
Look, there was a 10-year period

248
00:09:08,060 --> 00:09:09,500
每年感恩节
where there was at least one empty chair

249
00:09:09,500 --> 00:09:10,880
都至少有一个孩子不来看我
at my house every Thanksgiving

250
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:12,180
因为我总是喋喋不休
because I had a lot to say

251
00:09:12,180 --> 00:09:13,760
挑米奇尔和克莱尔对象的刺
about who Mitchell and Claire were dating.

252
00:09:14,500 --> 00:09:17,620
我做父亲就这一个败笔 吸取我的教训
So learn from my one and only parental mistake.

253
00:09:19,221 --> 00:09:21,400
或许凯伦和我该走了
Uh, maybe Karen and I should head out.

254
00:09:21,400 --> 00:09:23,720
-我觉得局面有些尴尬 -不不不
- I'm sensing some tension. - No, no, no.

255
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:24,720
这是你家
This is your house,

256
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:27,100
你在家里不该感到不舒服
and you're supposed to be comfortable here.

257
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:29,360
留下吧
So, just hang out.

258
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:30,596
再喝些葡萄酒
Have more wine.

259
00:09:30,596 --> 00:09:32,569
别担心开车的事
And don't worry about driving.

260
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:34,740
你们今晚可以留下过夜
You can spend the night here tonight.

261
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:36,000
你确定吗 妈
Are you sure, Mom?

262
00:09:36,100 --> 00:09:38,520
确定 我去再拿些葡萄酒来
Yeah, I'm sure. I'll go get some more wine.

263
00:09:40,380 --> 00:09:42,100
对她走路的姿势有什么建议吗
Any tips on how she moves?

264
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:44,000
我从没见过这样的身姿
I've never seen anything like it.

265
00:09:44,100 --> 00:09:44,460
是吧
Right?

266
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:47,020
你好啊 肖恩
Hello, Shane.

267
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:48,660
代理副校长塔克
Acting Vice Principal Tucker.

268
00:09:48,660 --> 00:09:50,840
我知道你认为你现在很讨人喜欢
I know you think you're pretty cute right now,

269
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,260
但在太阳落山前
but before this day is done,

270
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:55,020
我会让你承认是你上传了那个视频
I will get you to admit you sent out that video.

271
00:09:55,180 --> 00:09:56,200
的确是我上传了那个视频
I did send out that video.

272
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:57,660
我就知道你会老实招来
I knew you'd crack.

273
00:09:57,694 --> 00:09:58,112
听着
Look, uh...

274
00:09:58,660 --> 00:10:00,520
我很抱歉
I'm sorry.

275
00:10:00,580 --> 00:10:02,600
我只是很需要让这些孩子接受我
I just really need these kids to accept me.

276
00:10:02,820 --> 00:10:03,880
不 肖恩 你不需要
No, Shane, you don't.

277
00:10:03,920 --> 00:10:04,620
不过是他们很受欢迎
Because they're popular,

278
00:10:04,660 --> 00:10:06,200
让你认为你需要他们的认可
you think you need their approval.

279
00:10:08,660 --> 00:10:09,640
我是个警察
I'm a cop.

280
00:10:10,220 --> 00:10:11,220
是吗
Oh, are you, now?

281
00:10:11,620 --> 00:10:13,880
我们很关注这所学校内的毒品买卖情况
There's concern about some drug traffic at this school.

282
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:16,520
我是来卧底将他们一网打尽的
I am here, undercover, to shut it down.

283
00:10:18,260 --> 00:10:19,300
是吗是吗
Okay, yeah.

284
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:22,160
我其实早就知道你是警察
Okay, well, I kind of always knew you were police.

285
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,260
当然
Well, sure.

286
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:24,740
你也是执法人员
You're law enforcement, too.

287
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:26,200
同类之间有感应
We know our own.

288
00:10:26,580 --> 00:10:26,980
警察的双眼
Cop eyes.

289
00:10:28,380 --> 00:10:29,280
警察的双眼
Cop eyes.

290
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:30,100
好
Okay.

291
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,498
具体是怎么个情况
So what's the play?

292
00:10:31,498 --> 00:10:34,076
有种新型化合致幻药叫迪克吗啡
There's this new designer drug called Dexomorphone.

293
00:10:34,076 --> 00:10:35,564
孩子们叫它"傻子"
?Kids are calling them "Dum-Dums."

294
00:10:35,564 --> 00:10:37,650
今晚北校区举办篮球赛时
So there's this big deal going down tonight

295
00:10:37,650 --> 00:10:39,840
会有一场大买卖
on the north campus during the basketball game.

296
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:41,080
你想让我帮忙逮捕罪犯
And you want my help with the bust.

297
00:10:41,380 --> 00:10:41,900
是的
Yes.

298
00:10:42,580 --> 00:10:43,980
你的任务就是不要接近那里
By being nowhere near there.

299
00:10:44,020 --> 00:10:45,820
我不想吓跑这些毒贩子
I don't want to spook these dealers.

300
00:10:45,820 --> 00:10:46,780
收到
Copy that.

301
00:10:46,900 --> 00:10:48,060
但以防你需要后援
But in case you need backup,

302
00:10:48,100 --> 00:10:49,820
我应该在北校区附近待命
I should be near north campus.

303
00:10:50,940 --> 00:10:52,060
或者绝对不要接近
Or nowhere near there.

304
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:54,000
或者去
Or there...

305
00:10:54,900 --> 00:10:57,420
但缩在我车里以防被人看见
but slouched down in my car so no one sees me.

306
00:10:57,860 --> 00:10:58,820
或者留在你家里
Or at your house.

307
00:10:59,640 --> 00:11:00,000
了解
Right.

308
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:01,560
好的
Okay.

309
00:11:02,336 --> 00:11:03,421
警察的双眼
Cop eyes.

310
00:11:04,940 --> 00:11:06,840
好了 好了
Okay. Okay.

311
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:08,040
我们要去外面散步吗
Are we gonna go outside?

312
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:09,020
是的 去散步
Yes, we are.

313
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:10,960
小心
Careful.

314
00:11:11,420 --> 00:11:13,280
我告诉过你多少次不要把这个扔在这
How many times have I told you not to leave this here?

315
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:14,440
会有人被绊倒的
Someone's gonna trip on it.

316
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:16,160
我现在有很多烦恼顾不过来
There's a lot going on with me right now.

317
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:17,160
我的身体开始发育了
My body's changing.

318
00:11:17,400 --> 00:11:18,820
行了 你总用这个借口
Okay. You always use that.

319
00:11:18,940 --> 00:11:20,580
今天你要学会负责任
Hey, today, you're gonna learn about responsibility.

320
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:23,700
今天 你得照顾一个小宝宝
Today, you are gonna take care of a baby.

321
00:11:24,340 --> 00:11:25,600
你想要玩具吗
Do you want a toy?

322
00:11:26,660 --> 00:11:27,580
给你点严厉的爱
Little tough love.

323
00:11:27,994 --> 00:11:29,947
要我说早该这样了
Long overdo, if you ask me.

324
00:11:30,660 --> 00:11:32,500
但这样对你有好处 亲爱的
But it's gonna be good for you, sweetie.

325
00:11:33,620 --> 00:11:34,480
他哭了
He's crying.

326
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:36,140
宝宝都这样
Well, that's what babies do.

327
00:11:36,140 --> 00:11:38,436
你得抱起来哄哄他
You just got to pick it up, and you got to soothe it.

328
00:11:40,460 --> 00:11:41,760
那好吧
All right, then.

329
00:11:42,220 --> 00:11:43,240
-好 -没事的
- Okay. - It's okay.

330
00:11:43,880 --> 00:11:45,400
-起作用了 -很好
- It worked. - ?Good.

331
00:11:45,620 --> 00:11:47,300
到晚上前都要保持住
Just keep it up for the rest of the afternoon.

332
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:49,760
等等 我不知道该怎么做
Wait! I don't know what I'm supposed to do!

333
00:11:49,780 --> 00:11:51,420
欢迎体验家长生活
Well, welcome to being a parent.

334
00:11:53,580 --> 00:11:55,700
生存影像日志第二条
Survival vlog number two.

335
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:59,920
我潜水里去 试图找回我的装备
I descended into the water attempting to retrieve my gear.

336
00:12:00,060 --> 00:12:01,740
踩到了很滑的石头
I encountered slippery rocks...

337
00:12:02,280 --> 00:12:04,240
跌进了又冷又急的水流
...a cold, brisk current,

338
00:12:04,940 --> 00:12:07,020
尽管我没有影像证明
and although I have no photographic evidence of it,

339
00:12:07,040 --> 00:12:08,000
我看到了大海蛇
a sea serpent.

340
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:12,680
紧接着我翻腾时拍晕了一只路过的鳟鱼
My ensuing thrashing stunned a passing trout.

341
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:16,820
然后我找到了一些野莓和蜂蜜
I then foraged some wild blueberries and honey

342
00:12:16,820 --> 00:12:19,200
蜂蜜是从那个我后来才发现
from what turned out to be a not --

343
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:22,620
原来还没完全被废弃的蜂巢里弄的
altogether abandoned hive.

344
00:12:23,180 --> 00:12:24,720
这都证明了
Just goes to show you...

345
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:28,220
我不需要什么高级的设备
I don't need all that fancy equipment.

346
00:12:28,752 --> 00:12:32,051
菲尔·邓菲可以在野外生存 就连...
Phil Dunphy can survive in the wild, even --

347
00:12:37,740 --> 00:12:40,220
听起来挺大只的是吧
That sounded big, didn't it?

348
00:12:40,340 --> 00:12:43,020
幸好我闻起来像野莓 蜂蜜和生鱼
Good thing I smell like berries, honey, and raw fish,

349
00:12:43,020 --> 00:12:44,280
我简直就是人形的
so I'm basically all three courses

350
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:46,180
野熊最爱三道菜
of a bear's favorite meal!

351
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:53,800
就是这样
That's right.

352
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,300
都听听老娘的汽笛吧
Watch them scatter.

353
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:58,278
-你好 -你好啊 亲爱的
- Hello? - Oh, hi, honey!

354
00:12:58,278 --> 00:13:00,200
今天大多数时间我手机都没信号
I've been out of cell range for most of the day.

355
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:01,440
我就来关心一下看你好不好
I just wanted to check in, see how you're doing.

356
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:04,497
很好啊 太好了
Oh. Great, great.

357
00:13:04,497 --> 00:13:07,080
这空气 这树木...
The air, the, uh -- the trees...

358
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,940
苔藓通常都是长在树干的北面对吧
Moss only grows on the north side of trees, right?

359
00:13:08,940 --> 00:13:11,457
我感觉我有可能在绕圈子
I feel like I might be walking in circles.

360
00:13:11,457 --> 00:13:14,640
有没有什么傻子指路苔之类的啊
Is there something called, uh, fool's moss?

361
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:15,260
不知道耶
I don't know.

362
00:13:15,380 --> 00:13:16,800
你有点上气不接下气 还好吧
You sound out of breath. Is everything okay?

363
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:18,800
不好啊 克莱尔 我在害怕有熊
No, Claire, I'm worried that a bear

364
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:22,560
