375
00:13:43,580 --> 00:13:45,982
穿的是我十分容易辨识的防水夹克
in my very identifiable red Gore-Tex jacket.

376
00:13:45,982 --> 00:13:48,160
最后记得 付家里的园丁工资
Anyhoo, leave a check out for the gardener,

377
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:49,200
还有 是你让我人生有意义
and you gave my life meaning.

378
00:13:52,126 --> 00:13:53,774
你很爱笑 是不是啊
You're a giggly one, aren't ya?

379
00:13:53,924 --> 00:13:55,243
真怀念这声音
Oh, I miss that sound.

380
00:13:55,352 --> 00:13:56,560
您好 我能看看嘛
Hi. Can I look?

381
00:13:56,560 --> 00:13:58,720
莉莉 怎么样了
Hey, Lily, how's it going?

382
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:00,020
我很努力了
I'm trying my best,

383
00:14:00,020 --> 00:14:01,470
但我还是不确定做得对不对
but I don't really know what I'm doing.

384
00:14:01,470 --> 00:14:03,618
在它身上犯错总比以后对亲生的犯错好
Well, better to make your mistakes on this one.

385
00:14:03,618 --> 00:14:05,231
懂吧 你等我一下
You know? ?Oh, hold on one second.

386
