403
00:14:37,760 --> 00:14:40,220
但是拍摄这影片的学生 肖恩
but Shane, the guy who shot the video,

404
00:14:41,100 --> 00:14:44,160
其实是个卧底警察
is actually an undercover cop.

405
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:45,740
他拍这个影片的目的
Oh. ?Yeah, and he did the video

406
00:14:45,740 --> 00:14:47,380
是有点故意要羞辱老师
to sort of, like, humiliate me

407
00:14:47,380 --> 00:14:48,720
好在坏学生里混出名堂
to get some street cred.

408
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:52,100
而今晚有一场重大的毒品买卖
And there's a big drug deal going on tonight,

409
00:14:52,100 --> 00:14:54,040
但他要求我不要插手
but he wants me to steer clear.

410
00:14:54,300 --> 00:14:55,400
还有别人知道
Is anyone else aware of

411
00:14:55,400 --> 00:14:57,100
肖恩电影般的双重身份吗
Shane's "21 Jump Street" double life?

412
00:14:57,100 --> 00:14:59,300
他当然不会到处宣传
Well, he's not gonna broadcast it

413
00:14:59,300 --> 00:15:00,660
让别人知道这事啦
out loud for everyone.

414
00:15:00,740 --> 00:15:03,240
但他有给你看文件或是证件之类的吧
But you did get some paperwork or identification?

415
00:15:03,580 --> 00:15:04,280
你别说了 你知道吗
Okay. You know what?

416
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:05,500
我觉得其实挺好笑的
I think it's hilarious that

417
00:15:05,500 --> 00:15:08,460
你不相信的这个人是个英雄
the person you don't trust is a hero,

418
00:15:08,740 --> 00:15:10,720
而他正在打击校园的迪克吗啡
who's helping fight the Dexomorphone problem

419
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:11,479
-这如瘟疫般... -等等 什么鬼
- that's plaguing... - I'm sorry. What?

420
00:15:11,479 --> 00:15:13,314
那药品的街头名字叫"傻子"
The street name is "Dum-Dums,"

421
