而肖恩说这傻子已经到处都是了
and Shane says there's literally Dum-Dums everywhere.

422
00:15:16,180 --> 00:15:18,560
好的 所以肖恩
Okay. So, Shane --

423
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:21,799
不是个喜欢羞辱你的16岁毒品贩子
not a 16-year-old drug dealer who enjoys humiliating you --

424
00:15:21,799 --> 00:15:23,380
而是个娃娃脸警察
but a baby-faced police officer,

425
00:15:23,380 --> 00:15:24,780
他授权于你
has deputized you,

426
00:15:24,780 --> 00:15:25,940
让你进行的第一个任务
and your first assignment

427
00:15:25,940 --> 00:15:27,620
就是离他越远越好
is to stay as far away as possible

428
00:15:27,620 --> 00:15:30,520
因为有个叫"傻子"的毒品买卖要进行吗
from a huge "Dum-Dum" deal that's about to go down?

429
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:32,120
小卡 你不...
Cam, I mean, come --

430
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,520
我很爱你信任别人这点
I love how trusting you are,

431
00:15:33,520 --> 00:15:34,920
但当你开始没意识到
but when you start missing things

432
00:15:34,920 --> 00:15:37,160
这么明显的事情时... 你懂的
that are that obvious, then, well, you know,

433
00:15:37,160 --> 00:15:38,300
我不用再说下去了
I don't have to say anything more.

434
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:41,820
我可以自己弄完
You know, I can finish up here

435
00:15:41,820 --> 00:15:42,637
你想上楼就去吧
if you want to go upstairs.

436
00:15:42,637 --> 00:15:44,667
不用不用 没事
Nah, nah, I'm fine.

437
00:15:46,620 --> 00:15:48,240
其实呢
You know, um...

438
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:50,340
妈还挺让我讶异的
Mom really surprised me before.

439
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:53,540
因为这是她第一次把我当成大人般对待
This is the first time she's treating me like an adult.

440
00:15:53,540 --> 00:15:55,260
凯伦很好
And Karen's great.

441
00:15:55,560 --> 00:15:57,580
跟一个成熟的女性在一起很好
I mean, It's nice to be with a mature woman,

442
00:15:57,780 --> 00:15:58,840
她们比较有经验
someone with experience.

443
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:01,480
你们俩还没睡过吧
So you two haven't slept together, huh?

444
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:05,100
她提议我们来家里"睡"
She suggested we come here.

445
00:16:05,180 --> 00:16:05,880
我说行吧
I said fine.

446
00:16:06,780 --> 00:16:08,960
但你不知道我看到你们在家时有多庆幸
You don't know how relieved I was you guys were home.

447
00:16:09,300 --> 00:16:10,820
但结果妈这么坦然接受
But then Mom was so cool with it.

448
00:16:10,820 --> 00:16:12,480
那个哥伦比亚疯婆子上哪去了呢
I mean, where's the crazy Colombian

449
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:13,700
我唯一一次需要她救 她不见了
the one time I need her?

450
00:16:13,720 --> 00:16:14,460
已经擦干了
