451
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,260
但你是喜欢凯伦的吧
But you like Karen, right?

452
00:16:19,460 --> 00:16:21,420
很喜欢啊 可是...
A lot, but, I mean...

453
00:16:22,180 --> 00:16:23,700
她比我大不少已经有点糟糕了
bad enough she's older than I am,

454
00:16:23,740 --> 00:16:25,020
她还是我的律动教授
she's also a movement professor.

455
00:16:25,180 --> 00:16:26,401
我的老天爷 我过去人生中
I swear to God, before today,

456
00:16:26,401 --> 00:16:27,620
从来没听过律动与教授这两词合在一起
I'd never heard those two words together.

457
00:16:27,620 --> 00:16:28,860
但现在却不停听到
Now it's all I hear.

458
00:16:31,180 --> 00:16:31,760
听我说
Look...

459
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:33,360
紧张是很正常的
it's normal to be nervous.

460
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:36,280
别做任何你还没准备好的事
Don't do anything you're not ready for.

461
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,480
跟她谈谈你的感受
Talk to her about what you're feeling.

462
00:16:39,280 --> 00:16:41,940
你会很惊讶 一场开诚布公的交流
You'll be surprised how much easier things get

463
00:16:41,940 --> 00:16:44,680
能让事情变得简单多少
after one honest conversation.

464
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:47,240
谢了 杰
Thanks, Jay.

465
00:16:49,580 --> 00:16:50,880
一个好了 还有一个
One down, one to go.

466
00:16:51,140 --> 00:16:52,880
乔 要来谈谈了吗
Joe?! You ready to talk?

467
00:16:53,380 --> 00:16:55,040
就为了点燕麦葡萄干饼干吗
For oatmeal raisin?

468
00:16:55,220 --> 00:16:57,080
别浪费我的时间了
Don't waste my time.

469
00:16:58,480 --> 00:16:59,629
这货正点吗
Is this stuff any good?

470
00:16:59,629 --> 00:17:00,460
必需得正点啊
It better be.

471
00:17:00,460 --> 00:17:02,340
我花掉一半的成年礼基金买的呢
I laid out half my bar mitzvah bonds to get it.

472
00:17:02,660 --> 00:17:04,380
对了 塔克教练的影片很赞啊
Sick movie of Coach Tucker, by the way.

473
00:17:05,300 --> 00:17:06,780
你们喜欢那影片就好
Glad you enjoyed the film, boys.

474
00:17:06,940 --> 00:17:08,240
现在你们也能当影片主角了
Now you can be in one of your own!

475
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:09,540
你他妈在干嘛呢
What the hell are you doing?!

476
00:17:09,740 --> 00:17:10,220
干我的工作
My job.

477
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:12,300
看来我是个真真正正的副校长啊
I guess I really am a vice principal.

478
00:17:12,780 --> 00:17:14,420
一个《迈阿密重案组[副]》校长
A Miami vice principal --

479
00:17:14,460 --> 00:17:16,200
不对 好像不需要那个"迈阿密"也行
No, I guess it doesn't really need the "Miami," does it.

480
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:17,480
我真是信了你的邪
I can't believe this.

481
00:17:17,580 --> 00:17:18,500
被我人赃并获了吧
You're busted.

482
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:19,499
我们来看看你身上有什么
What do we got here?

483
00:17:19,499 --> 00:17:21,559
我猜猜 有你的毒品钱...
Oh, let me guess -- your -- your drug money,

484
00:17:21,559 --> 00:17:22,840
对讲机
walkie-talkie.

485
00:17:22,840 --> 00:17:23,360
这是什么
What's this?

486
00:17:23,840 --> 00:17:24,480
警徽
A badge.

487
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:29,240
米奇尔真是欠你个天大的道歉啊
Mitchell's really gonna owe you an apology.

488
00:17:35,700 --> 00:17:37,480
坚持开车 兄弟
Drive strong, brother.

489
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,340
克莱尔
Hey, Claire.

490
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:45,100
亲爱的 你怎么样啦
Hi, honey. How's it going?

491
00:17:45,320 --> 00:17:47,580
坐在一条完美的山林小溪旁
Just sitting here by a perfect mountain stream.

492
00:17:47,820 --> 00:17:50,420
没有什么比大自然中的原始之美还赞的了
Nothing beats the raw beauty of the great outdoors.

493
00:17:51,260 --> 00:17:52,340
你那边怎么样了
How's everything going there?

494
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:53,680
好得不能再好
Couldn't be better.

495
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:55,200
我现在在回家的路上
I'm on my way home now,

496
00:17:55,200 --> 00:17:56,620
我们今天缺了一个卡车司机
but we were down a driver,

497
00:17:56,620 --> 00:17:58,760
所以我得到开卡车的机会
so I got to drive a truck today,

498
00:17:58,760 --> 00:18:00,580
我真是爱死了
and I'm loving it.

499
00:18:00,700 --> 00:18:02,380
让我感觉自己像个真正的爷们
Makes me feel like a real man.

500
00:18:02,760 --> 00:18:03,320
是吗
Yeah?

501
00:18:03,860 --> 00:18:05,080
那是什么感觉啊
What's that feel like?

502
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:06,440
你发生什么事了吗
Something going on with you?

503
00:18:08,760 --> 00:18:12,680
亲爱的 其实我... 我没有跟你坦白
Honey, I haven't been, uh, totally honest with you.

504
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:16,520
不是我自己离开地产公司的
I didn't quit Woosnam, Keneally & Dunphy.

505
00:18:17,860 --> 00:18:19,160
他们... 是他们让我走的
They -- They asked me to leave.

506
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:21,320
亲爱的 怎么回事
Oh, honey. What happened?

507
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:23,240
反正就是
Well, you know,

508
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:25,120
他们都是很野性很凶狠的一群人
those guys have always been super aggressive,

509
00:18:25,120 --> 00:18:26,400
而他们觉得
and they didn't feel like

510
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:27,740
我没有他们那样的
I have the same killer instinct

511
00:18:28,320 --> 00:18:29,980
杀手本性之类的
that -- that they do.

512
00:18:32,340 --> 00:18:33,380
或许他们说的没错
Maybe they're right.

513
00:18:33,540 --> 00:18:36,860
所以你这个神经病露营就是为了这个吗
Is that what this whole crazy camping thing is about?

514
00:18:36,940 --> 00:18:38,140
证明自己是个硬汉
Proving how tough you are?

515
00:18:38,380 --> 00:18:39,480
可能... 有一点吧
Maybe, a little,

516
00:18:39,700 --> 00:18:41,680
尤其是我现在得自己出去闯
especially since I'll be going out on my own.

517
00:18:42,100 --> 00:18:44,800
菲尔 你在独自承受的不是小事啊
Phil, this is a huge thing you've been going through.

518
00:18:45,280 --> 00:18:46,340
你为什么没跟我说呢
Why didn't you say something?

519
00:18:46,388 --> 00:18:48,262
你这周这么忙
Well, you've had such a busy week.

520
00:18:48,500 --> 00:18:51,200
你到处救火 我不想自己也给你放火
I don't want to be another fire you had to put out.

521
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:53,000
你听我说
Okay, listen to me.

522
00:18:53,340 --> 00:18:56,260
还记得我刚从爸那里接手公司时多害怕吗
Remember how terrified I was when I took over for my dad?

523
00:18:56,840 --> 00:18:59,360
在我首日要当老板的前晚
The night before my first day in the big office,

524
00:18:59,420 --> 00:19:01,422
我睡不着 心砰砰跳
I was up, heart pounding,

525
00:19:01,422 --> 00:19:03,580
在客厅疯狂来回踱步
pacing a hole in the living-room floor.

526
00:19:03,580 --> 00:19:05,820
突然你就来了
And suddenly, you were there.

527
00:19:06,100 --> 00:19:08,040
你把手臂放我肩膀上
You just put your arms around me,

528
00:19:08,040 --> 00:19:09,180
