and it made me realize

529
00:19:09,180 --> 00:19:11,360
一切风雨都有你来陪伴
I'm not going through this alone.

530
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:15,580
忘了你的白痴合伙人们
So forget your idiot partners

531
00:19:15,580 --> 00:19:17,280
以及你想要在这次露营
and whatever it is you're trying to prove

532
00:19:17,280 --> 00:19:19,000
证明的一切白痴事情
