533
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:23,280
你做事可厉害了 还有...
You're great at what you do, and also...

534
00:19:24,340 --> 00:19:24,757
什么
What?

535
00:19:24,757 --> 00:19:26,273
你怎... 怎么...
How -- How --

536
00:19:26,273 --> 00:19:27,680
我要挂电话了
I'm gonna hang up now.

537
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:28,720
我爱你 再见
I love you. Goodbye.

538
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:32,600
你电话上听起来不太对劲
You didn't sound so good on the phone.

539
00:19:33,080 --> 00:19:34,340
所以我就打给酒店
I called the hotel,

540
00:19:34,460 --> 00:19:36,300
他们说你提前入住了
and they said you checked in early.

541
00:19:36,800 --> 00:19:38,920
亲爱的 我知道我常抱怨
Honey, I know I like to complain

542
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:40,960
总有人来找我解决他们的问题
about people coming to me to solve their problems,

543
00:19:41,040 --> 00:19:43,640
但永远不许你有问题不找我帮忙
but don't you dare not come to me with yours.

544
00:19:43,860 --> 00:19:45,158
其实呢 如果你不想要别人
By the way, if you don't want people

545
00:19:45,158 --> 00:19:47,120
总是来找你帮忙解决他们的问题
to come to you to solve their problems all the time,

546
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:48,360
那你就不要那么厉害啊
maybe don't be so good at it.

547
00:19:54,120 --> 00:19:56,980
既然你这么喜欢野性...
Now that you're so into the wild...

548
00:19:56,980 --> 00:20:00,060
我喜欢这话的走向
I like where this is going.

549
00:20:00,324 --> 00:20:02,338
别这样 求你了
Don't...do that, please.

550
00:20:06,620 --> 00:20:07,540
你还好吧
You okay?

551
00:20:08,888 --> 00:20:11,017
乔在楼下的小堡垒里睡觉
Joe is sleeping in a fort downstairs,

552
00:20:11,017 --> 00:20:13,897
而曼尼在楼上跟个博士睡
and Manny's upstairs sleeping with a doctor.

553
00:20:14,800 --> 00:20:17,520
-我都搞不懂还有什么规矩了 -没人懂
- I don't know what the rules are anymore. - No one does,

554
00:20:17,600 --> 00:20:18,500
但无论如何
but for what it's worth,

555
00:20:18,500 --> 00:20:19,820
我觉得你做了正确的选择
I think you made the right call.

556
00:20:20,020 --> 00:20:22,420
老娘起码得赢一场
I am at least winning one of these fights.

557
00:20:24,040 --> 00:20:24,816
要去攻打堡垒了吗
Storming the fort?

558
00:20:24,816 --> 00:20:27,160
我要下楼去把他给抓出来
I'm gonna go and drag him out of there

559
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:28,420
拖他回床上睡觉
and put him in his bed.

560
00:20:28,800 --> 00:20:30,241
我好歹还比乔高大
I'm still bigger than Joe,

561
00:20:30,241 --> 00:20:32,140
虽然曼尼也还是...
even though that Manny's, like...

562
00:20:33,740 --> 00:20:35,040
相信我
Trust me.

563
00:20:35,728 --> 00:20:38,452
曼尼心里的小男生一直都在
The little boy in Manny isn't gone yet.

564
00:20:54,460 --> 00:20:56,140
终于啊 你去哪了
Finally, where have you been?

565
00:20:56,180 --> 00:20:57,740
我带卡尔出去散步了
I have been out walking Cal.

566
00:20:57,860 --> 00:20:59,400
你猜谁在我后面
And guess who's right behind me.

567
00:20:59,520 --> 00:21:00,860
其实我才是...
Actually, I've been the one who...

568
00:21:00,860 --> 00:21:03,400
配合得好就能去迪士尼乐园玩的女孩
Will be going to Disneyland if she plays her cards right.

569
00:21:04,060 --> 00:21:05,139
我的小天使在哪里
Where's my little angel.

570
00:21:05,139 --> 00:21:07,487
跟我说说你按摩怎么样了
Tell me about your rub down.

571
00:21:07,760 --> 00:21:08,720
糟糕
Oh, oh boy.

572
00:21:08,840 --> 00:21:10,280
没事 我能捡起来
Oh, I can get it.

573
00:21:10,280 --> 00:21:14,160
我现在轻松又放松 捡东西什么的都没问题
Now I'm so free and loose, I can pick up anything, move around.

574
00:21:14,560 --> 00:21:15,589
是的 我就像个猫头鹰
Yep, I'm like an owl.

575
00:21:15,589 --> 00:21:18,629
我的小天使来啦
There is my little angel.

576
00:21:18,740 --> 00:21:20,179
真是太谢谢你了
You know what? Thanks for this.

577
00:21:20,179 --> 00:21:22,380
让我请你吃点东西 来吧
Let me treat you for a bite. Come on.

578
00:21:22,380 --> 00:21:23,400
莉莉 我们马上回来
Lily, we'll be right back.

579
00:21:23,980 --> 00:21:25,700
-他表现好吗 -超安静 超乖
- How was he? - So quiet, so easy!
